## 3. API + 高层架构

### 3.1 核心 API

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    API["RESTful API"] --> H["hotel CRUD<br/>(员工限)"]
    API --> R["room CRUD<br/>(员工限)"]
    API --> RV["reservation<br/>GET/POST/DELETE"]
    RV --> ID["reservation_id 作幂等键 ⭐<br/>(防重复点击双订)"]

    style API fill:#FFE082,stroke:#F9A825,color:#1f1f1f
