    style CDN fill:#A5D6A7,stroke:#388E3C,color:#1f1f1f
    style GW fill:#80DEEA,stroke:#0097A7,color:#1f1f1f
    style IAPI fill:#80DEEA,stroke:#0097A7,color:#1f1f1f
    style HS fill:#80DEEA,stroke:#0097A7,color:#1f1f1f
    style RS fill:#80DEEA,stroke:#0097A7,color:#1f1f1f
    style RV fill:#CE93D8,stroke:#7B1FA2,color:#1f1f1f
    style PS fill:#FFCC80,stroke:#F57C00,color:#1f1f1f
    style HMS fill:#80DEEA,stroke:#0097A7,color:#1f1f1f
```

| 服务 | 职责 |
|------|------|
| **Hotel Service** | 酒店房型详情(静态,可缓存) |
| **Rate Service** | 动态价格(满房率决定) |
| **Reservation Service** ⭐ | 预订 + 库存追踪 |
| **Payment Service** | 支付,改预订状态(paid/rejected) |
| **Hotel Mgmt Service** | 员工管理后台 |

> 💡 **服务间通信用 gRPC**(高性能 RPC)。

